  ],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "The simplest idea is generate every possible permutation, then arrange all of them in lexical graphical order.",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 8400,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 252,
      "word_count": 17
    },
    {
      "text": "After that, find our current permutation in that list and take the one immediately after it.",
      "start_ms": 9120,
      "end_ms": 15900,
      "start_frame": 274,
      "end_frame": 477,
      "word_count": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "For a very small array, this idea is easy to understand.",
      "start_ms": 16500,
      "end_ms": 21100,
      "start_frame": 495,
      "end_frame": 633,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "Suppose we have 1, 2, 3.",
      "start_ms": 21520,
      "end_ms": 24340,
      "start_frame": 646,
      "end_frame": 730,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "Its permutations can be arranged like this.",
      "start_ms": 24340,
      "end_ms": 26860,
      "start_frame": 730,
      "end_frame": 806,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "1, 2, 3.",
      "start_ms": 27420,
      "end_ms": 28000,
      "start_frame": 823,
      "end_frame": 840,
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "1, 3, 2.",
      "start_ms": 28400,
      "end_ms": 29220,
      "start_frame": 852,
      "end_frame": 877,
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "2, 1, 3.",
      "start_ms": 29640,
      "end_ms": 30780,
      "start_frame": 889,
      "end_frame": 923,
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "2, 3, 1.",
      "start_ms": 31260,
      "end_ms": 32340,
      "start_frame": 938,
      "end_frame": 970,
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "3, 1, 2.",
      "start_ms": 32880,
      "end_ms": 34040,
      "start_frame": 986,
      "end_frame": 1021,
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "3, 2, 1.",
      "start_ms": 34540,
      "end_ms": 36180,
      "start_frame": 1036,
      "end_frame": 1085,
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "If our current permutation is 1, 3, 2, then the next one is 2, 1, 3.",
      "start_ms": 36720,
      "end_ms": 42960,
      "start_frame": 1102,
      "end_frame": 1289,
      "word_count": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "So the definition is clear.",
      "start_ms": 43760,
      "end_ms": 45180,
      "start_frame": 1313,
      "end_frame": 1355,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Generate everything.",
      "start_ms": 45900,
      "end_ms": 47000,
      "start_frame": 1377,
      "end_frame": 1410,
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "Order everything.",
      "start_ms": 47780,
      "end_ms": 48520,
      "start_frame": 1433,
      "end_frame": 1456,
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "Find the current arrangement.",
      "start_ms": 49440,
      "end_ms": 50900,
      "start_frame": 1483,
      "end_frame": 1527,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "Then move one step forward.",
      "start_ms": 51500,
      "end_ms": 53140,
      "start_frame": 1545,
      "end_frame": 1594,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "And if we are already at the last permutation, we wrap around to the first one.",
      "start_ms": 53140,
      "end_ms": 59720,
      "start_frame": 1594,
      "end_frame": 1792,
      "word_count": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "This works logically.",
      "start_ms": 60100,
      "end_ms": 61680,
      "start_frame": 1803,
      "end_frame": 1850,
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "But there is a serious problem.",
      "start_ms": 62480,
      "end_ms": 64420,
      "start_frame": 1874,
      "end_frame": 1933,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "The number of permutations grows extremely fast.",
      "start_ms": 65140,
      "end_ms": 68840,
      "start_frame": 1954,
      "end_frame": 2065,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "So before we accept this method, let's see what its code is really doing.",
      "start_ms": 69600,
      "end_ms": 75720,
      "start_frame": 2088,
      "end_frame": 2272,
      "word_count": 14
    }
  ],
